// Golden test: Free-floating test declarations
// Spec: 08-declarations.md § Test Declarations
// Design: tooling/formatter/design/02-constructs/declarations.md
// Note: Free-floating tests use `tests _` syntax

use std.testing { assert, assert_eq }

@test_integration tests _ () -> void = assert(cond: true);

@test_smoke tests _ () -> void = assert_eq(actual: 1, expected: 1);
